<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112458" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠγᾰδ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for an exile,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. προθυμία</span> the reckless zeal
				<i>of a refugee,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἐλπίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pel.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. νῆσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.603b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. οἰκίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).196.24
				</span></i>
			 (Eretria, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				φυγαδικοί,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ φυγάδες</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				22.10.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.63
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.32
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, ζῶντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
